{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hey Gina, thanks for being there for me and believing in me. It means a lot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-cf1f043d36cd5be7bdfec4a9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.462998+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cf1f043d36cd5be7bdfec4a9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cf1f043d36cd5be7bdfec4a9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Sure, Jon! I'm always around for you. How've you been since we caught up?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-9b6552c27ec57db4d7538dc0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.482126+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9b6552c27ec57db4d7538dc0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9b6552c27ec57db4d7538dc0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I'm prepping for my dance studio more than ever!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-0b2cdd2a6eb4e089618b5587", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.493244+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0b2cdd2a6eb4e089618b5587", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0b2cdd2a6eb4e089618b5587", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Proud of you for starting your own business! It takes strength to stay hopeful. What are you doing to prep for your dance studio? I have developed a video presentation to teach how to style my fashion pieces, btw."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-8752306ae0d020e066699c5a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.505381+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8752306ae0d020e066699c5a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8752306ae0d020e066699c5a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! It's been so inspiring to work with our young dancers, seeing their passion and commitment. Opening the dance studio's been a great experience - I want it to be a place of support and encouragement for all our dancers. Will you show me this presentation?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-b9da25e3d4e096724ed3424a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.514020+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b9da25e3d4e096724ed3424a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b9da25e3d4e096724ed3424a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Shure, I will send it to you later. Starting this studio isn't just a business, it's a place for dancers to grow. What support are you offering them?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-38110a014fa2c5b57d3cb9a3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.532404+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "38110a014fa2c5b57d3cb9a3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "38110a014fa2c5b57d3cb9a3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Besides the dance classes and workshops, I'm offering one-on-one mentoring and training to help dancers reach their full potential."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-a06a882e08420bc6f910ad89", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.544458+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a06a882e08420bc6f910ad89", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a06a882e08420bc6f910ad89", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Your one-on-one mentoring and training will really push dancers to reach their goals. I totally get it, I had a mentor too when I was learning how to dance."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-191f339e56f85af5d785d37e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.555673+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "191f339e56f85af5d785d37e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "191f339e56f85af5d785d37e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Yeah, a mentor can do wonders. Guidance and support can help dancers really shine."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-4503e1480266d152d0945a04", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.569511+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4503e1480266d152d0945a04", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4503e1480266d152d0945a04", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Nice one, Jon! How've you been using it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-72db32436912634467d17075", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.579876+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "72db32436912634467d17075", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "72db32436912634467d17075", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I'm using it to stay organized and motivated. It sets goals, tracks my achievements and helps me find areas to improve."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-0077fd7415a6a912664ec5a2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.590659+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0077fd7415a6a912664ec5a2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0077fd7415a6a912664ec5a2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Really cool system! Being organized sure is key for getting stuff done. How do you keep up with your goals and progress?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-81597c6d33c4e9311753c314", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.602184+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "81597c6d33c4e9311753c314", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "81597c6d33c4e9311753c314", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I also use whiteboard to stay on track, visualize goals and tokenize successes. It keeps me motivated and focused."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-f541bd8bee0fa8fb85bf3b13", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.615413+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f541bd8bee0fa8fb85bf3b13", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f541bd8bee0fa8fb85bf3b13", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Cool! Are you using different colors?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-9a278a7863e35e2b6f5af746", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.625326+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a278a7863e35e2b6f5af746", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a278a7863e35e2b6f5af746", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Yes. I color-code achievements so I can easily track my progress and stay motivated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-60cbef4b75ab6fc2f239d491", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.637352+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "60cbef4b75ab6fc2f239d491", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "60cbef4b75ab6fc2f239d491", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow, color-coding is a great way to track your progress & stay motivated. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-ff806b126e97bbfd1219f0d2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.645855+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ff806b126e97bbfd1219f0d2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ff806b126e97bbfd1219f0d2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! It helps me stay motivated and reminds me why I'm doing this."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-0456db00071c887b83398944", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.660042+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0456db00071c887b83398944", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0456db00071c887b83398944", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Yeah, its a great idea!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-e65a850b3c36214f31156fac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.673660+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e65a850b3c36214f31156fac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e65a850b3c36214f31156fac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-5e3c28e72b5bba50af67c076", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.683953+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e3c28e72b5bba50af67c076", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e3c28e72b5bba50af67c076", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Remember that staying positive is very important. Rock on!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-2ec3f8c143e878350554e3ee", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.695451+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2ec3f8c143e878350554e3ee", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2ec3f8c143e878350554e3ee", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! Your support's really been awesome."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-a2d7fa63f235bb681c13d291", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.706566+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a2d7fa63f235bb681c13d291", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a2d7fa63f235bb681c13d291", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! Keep going for your dreams and don't quit!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-c10bf6369e8fe9d493f6c7d1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.719309+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c10bf6369e8fe9d493f6c7d1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c10bf6369e8fe9d493f6c7d1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I won't give up, Gina! I'll keep pushing and working to make my dreams happen. Thanks for the support!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_13-faee535814e5d0ea494be7fe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:51.731198+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "faee535814e5d0ea494be7fe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "faee535814e5d0ea494be7fe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
